          "chunk_index": 3,
          "chunk_id": "s03_c03",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c3_studies_trained_cnns_show_early",
          "text": "Studies of trained CNNs show that early layers learn strongly color-selective neurons, which suggests color is a natural axis for equivariance.",
