          "chunk_id": "s03_c04",
          "anchor_id": "cue_s03_c4_motivates_treating_hue_shift_same",
          "text": "This motivates treating a hue shift the same way prior work treated a rotation: as a symmetry the network should respect by design, rather than something it must relearn from data.",
