          "anchor_id": "cue_s07_c4_controlled_long_tailed_experiment_eq",
          "text": "In the controlled long-tailed experiment the equivariant network reaches ninety-one percent against the baseline's seventy-two percent, with the biggest improvements exactly on the rare classes that shape sharing is meant to help.",
