          "anchor_id": "cue_s08_c1_ablations_clarify_design_choices_inc",
          "text": "The ablations clarify the design choices. Increasing the number of discrete hue rotations makes the network more robust to test-time hue shifts, though it slightly reduces capacity because channels must shrink to keep parameters fixed.",
